  "content_text": "\r\n    \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \n            Manhattan Active SCALE Documentation\r\n        How To Add Web API Exit Point\r\n    \r\n    \r\n         \n                Collapse All\n                Expand All\n            \r\n        View with Navigation Tools\r\n    \r\n    \r\nExtensibility\r\n > Web API Exit Point\r\n > How To Add Web API Exit Point\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \r\n       \r\n\r\n    Web API Exit Point needs to add before configuring the exit point.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n     Steps to Add Web API Exit Point\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    Needs to follow the below steps to add an Exit Point for a Web API. In below example we are adding exit point for WorkInstructionsApi API.\r\n\r\n    - Get the URI from SDK for this API.\r\n\r\n     \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    -Go to SCALE  Exit Point Control configuration screen . Open Exit Point Control for WebAPI category.\r\n\r\n     \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    -Click on \"Actions\" from above screen. On  \"Add Exit Point\" selection below screen will display.\r\n\r\n     \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    -Select \"Action\" and enter the \"API\", \"Method\"  as mentioned in URI .\r\n\r\n    For the above API Action should be POST, API WorkInstructionsApi and Method workInstructions\r\n\r\n     \r\n\r\n    -Execute must be selected in case of POST\\PUT action.\r\n\r\n    After must be selected in case Exit Point returns custom json along with API response.Otherwise Before  must be selected .\r\n\n            \n            \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \n  ©2026 Manhattan Associates. All Rights Reserved.\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n",
  "search_text": "\r\n    \n\r\n        \r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n            \nManhattan Active SCALE Documentation\n\r\n        \n\nHow To Add Web API Exit Point\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n         \n                Collapse All\n                Expand All\n            \r\n        View with Navigation Tools\r\n    \n\r\n    \n\n\n\n\r\nExtensibility\r\n > Web API Exit Point\r\n > How To Add Web API Exit Point\n\n\n\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \n\r\n        \n\r\n       \r\n\r\n    \nWeb API Exit Point needs to add before configuring the exit point.\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n     Steps to Add Web API Exit Point\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n    Needs to follow the below steps to add an Exit Point for a Web API. In below example we are adding exit point for WorkInstructionsApi API.\r\n\r\n    \n- Get the URI from SDK for this API.\n\r\n\r\n    \n \n\r\n\r\n    \n\n\r\n\r\n    \n-Go to SCALE  Exit Point Control configuration screen . Open Exit Point Control for WebAPI category.\n\r\n\r\n    \n \n\r\n\r\n    \n\n\r\n\r\n    \n-Click on \"Actions\" from above screen. On  \"Add Exit Point\" selection below screen will display.\n\r\n\r\n    \n \n\r\n\r\n    \n\n\r\n\r\n    \n-Select \"Action\" and enter the \"API\", \"Method\"  as mentioned in URI .\n\r\n\r\n    \nFor the above API Action should be POST, API WorkInstructionsApi and Method workInstructions\n\r\n\r\n    \n \n\r\n\r\n    \n-Execute must be selected in case of POST\\PUT action.\n\r\n\r\n    \nAfter must be selected in case Exit Point returns custom json along with API response.Otherwise Before  must be selected .\n\r\n\n\n            \n            \r\n        \r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n©2026 Manhattan Associates. All Rights Reserved.\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n",
